&lt;p&gt;Pay range: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Propulsion Technician/Level 1: $23.00 - $27.00/hour &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Propulsion Technician/Level 2: $26.00 - $32.50/hour &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Propulsion Technician/Level 3: $31.00 - $38.00/hour &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
