&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is developing a satellite-to-mobile network to deliver cellular connectivity worldwide through the Starlink constellation. We are partnering with mobile network operators globally to provide direct-to-cell service, extending coverage to billions of existing cellular devices. Starlink Mobile is designed to connect the unconnected, and this new product will greatly expand that mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an antenna engineer on the Starlink Mobile program, you will be responsible for the design, verification, and validation of the phased array antennas that make satellite-to-mobile communication possible. You will interact regularly with senior leadership to influence the fundamental operation of our constellation and network while collaborating with electrical, silicon, software, mechanical, and manufacturing teams to steer this project from a conceptual design to full-scale production.&lt;/p&gt;
