&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of professional experience working with electrical or data acquisition systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience designing electrical, mechanical, or control systems (experience from a university or trade school qualifies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
