&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Able to travel for business trips as needed (up to&amp;nbsp;25%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
