&lt;li&gt;Must be able&amp;nbsp;to lift a minimum of 25 lbs. unassisted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to stand for extended periods – 8 hours minimum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
