&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;BUILD SPECIALIST, BARREL PRODUCTION (STARSHIP)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;The Build Specialist for Barrels and Domes Primary Structures focused on Root Cause, Escalations &amp;amp; Line Efficiency ensures quality, reliability, and efficient production of Starship’s core propellant tank structures. Through root-cause analysis, escalations ownership, and line optimization, the role enables the production rates and structural integrity needed for Starship’s high flight cadence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;84e248cd-8303-431b-9f29-ad34d8cc8b1f&quot;&gt;Lead relentless, data-driven root cause analysis (5 Whys, fishbone, Pareto, etc.) on complex equipment failures, quality defects, process variability, and unplanned downtime; implement permanent countermeasures, poka-yoke solutions, and preventive/predictive strategies to eliminate repeat problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;aabcbc82-f24a-4cca-9335-0385388270f3&quot;&gt;Own engineering escalations end-to-end: triage issues, coordinate with design/manufacturing/build reliability engineers, drive rapid resolution, verify fixes at the gemba, and document thoroughly for full traceability and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;53177dcc-080f-45ae-a1bb-65e9c0122e7a&quot;&gt;Drive day-to-day waste reduction and line efficiency on flexible barrel lines—optimize workflow, part flow, mixed-product sequencing, workstation layout, and material presentation to cut non-value-added time and improve throughput&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b831377c-140d-4b46-b430-e1ec8e0b7ec9&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot complex equipment and tooling issues, support repairs, and manage model/tooling changes to minimize disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;c199c4bf-f1d2-44b9-9a3b-483142697ede&quot;&gt;Conduct quality inspections, enforce process standards, escalate non-conformances immediately, and mentor technicians on best practices and standard work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;880f5ca9-ba14-45e6-adb1-d61a5b896a73&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement and 5S: update work instructions, standardize best practices to close skill gaps and accelerate knowledge transfer, and implement workstation/process optimizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;44c9d268-c4e3-4fde-b317-e0aca1694180&quot;&gt;Support assembly process updates, new equipment integration, and seamless cross-shift/cross-department coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;fbf4d382-5c52-45a6-9d69-eaa7b2ccb445&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering to improve utilization efficiency—provide clear feedback, data, and recommendations that reduce rework loops and strengthen the production-engineering partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;8c6fddd2-9f77-4a10-b45b-84defdb5af63&quot;&gt;Verify safety, compliance, and process integrity on the floor; ensure every fix is robust and sustainable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate and 2+ years of professional experience in a hands-on manufacturing environment; OR Bachelor&#39;s degree in an engineering, math, or science discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate or bachelor&#39;s degree in an engineering, math, or science discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;285fd437-5572-4532-b934-ce589c6ee158&quot;&gt;2+ years in a manufacturing, process planning, or continuous improvement role with strong root-cause ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional experience in an aerospace, aviation, automotive, and/or manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1116a8b4-2166-46e1-9025-03f6a098c49d&quot;&gt;Experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;automated laser welding / laser cutting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;0173c8e0-f5f7-41f2-b9a1-be8cc0014559&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading structured problem-solving (5 Whys, A3, 8D, etc.) and implementing permanent countermeasures that prevent recurrence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;02f54e31-e4d9-4d6b-973b-c01fe41ca50d&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Lean tools (5S, waste elimination, value-stream thinking, Kanban, OEE, PFMEA, poka-yoke)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;4b846442-f57c-4495-9672-10d76db2a1ac&quot;&gt;Strong data analysis skills (Excel, VBA, SQL, or similar) for downtime, quality, and efficiency metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;7563755b-993a-4602-b871-6e8cbba3e87b&quot;&gt;Experience mentoring technicians, enforcing standards, and driving knowledge transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;617ec521-3c6b-4c79-abbe-edb4070925e2&quot;&gt;Experience with equipment troubleshooting, tooling changes, workstation optimization, and flexible/mixed-model lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;00896060-0e7d-440f-a9b6-db94dbb18550&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills; ability to escalate clearly and partner effectively with engineering and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;2b78ca3f-730b-4d15-adf0-d2dc17e6191b&quot;&gt;Experience taking processes from development through rate production with focus on design for manufacturability and assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold&quot;&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;86bd4ab1-d382-42b6-ab05-0b0ecc3895ad&quot;&gt;Must be able to work all shifts, overtime, and weekends as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;4cd9f3a0-c289-43d6-a384-53e0809449a8&quot;&gt;Ability to stand for extended periods (8+ hours minimum)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;1f9b1fe5-caa4-4ba4-8f2a-95fc6628670f&quot;&gt;Must be able to lift up to 25 lbs unassisted (and up to 50 lbs for short durations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;5d3a4861-4914-4cda-bd00-9d7b2bc0a7f4&quot;&gt;Must be able to travel up to 5%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;e1b43874-4545-4f06-9275-194fcafccf8e&quot;&gt;Ability to work at elevated heights (up to 200 feet) and in confined spaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;495cdc65-eb12-4e93-9bf8-22376340aa88&quot;&gt;Able to work outdoors (heat, cold, rain) and in environments with fumes, odors, and noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;844e1db8-dd11-4b0d-bd14-954175b9f3cc&quot;&gt;Physical demands (approximate daily):
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand/Walk: up to 10 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sit: up to 3 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push/Pull: up to 75 lbs (unassisted) 1–2 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overhead reach / Upper body twist / Kneel/Crouch: up to 6 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Climb (ladder/stairs): up to 3 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lift/Carry: up to 50 lbs (unassisted) 1–2 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in temperatures over 80°F for short periods (≤30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
