&lt;li&gt;Assess consumer insights and analytics to identify winning &amp;amp; losing demand generation approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development and execution of strategic growth programs (e.g., campaigns, new channels) to maximize customer acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
