&lt;div class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of civil technical experience with working knowledge in construction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in technical skills in&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;pump design,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;storm water management, hydraulics, hydrological analysis, grading and other site development related designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of other disciplines such as electrical, piping, geotechnical, electrical and surveying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Engineering (PE)&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;or Engineer-in-Training (EIT)&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to rapidly change roles/responsibilities while maintaining a high sense of urgency in a high-paced, challenging work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with project management of major construction projects including estimating, cost control, schedule, and contractor management&lt;/li&gt;
