&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in calculating percent grade, calculating volumes, and establishing and using site benchmarks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in performing topographic, construction staking, and as-builts using GPS and/or total station equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience installing civil infrastructure such as utilities, and structural concrete&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage priorities and multiple projects at once with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with project management of major construction projects including estimating, cost control, schedule, and contractor management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in directing work in the field between trades and contractors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using AutoCAD or Revit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
