&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CONSTRUCTION PROJECT MANAGER, RESIDENTIAL (STARBASE DEVELOPMENT)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Starbase Development team is seeking a Residential Construction Project Manager to spearhead the design, construction, and activation of cutting-edge residential and commercial infrastructure in Starbase, TX. Your role will be pivotal to support the development of sustainable, high-performance living spaces that support the next era of space exploration at Starbase and select SpaceX facilities. This full-time position is based in South Texas (Brownsville/South Padre area), offering you the autonomy to innovate and impact at a groundbreaking scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee all facets of multi-disciplinary residential construction projects on-site, from foundation to finish, with a focus on quality and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the full project lifecycle for residential builds, prioritizing customer satisfaction, sustainability, and operational readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solicit and evaluate proposals from architects, engineers, and residential contractors; award contracts to drive value and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, negotiate, and manage comprehensive construction contracts specializing in residential disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop detailed project controls, including scheduling, budgeting, and cost management for residential developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop accurate preliminary cost estimates based on residential scopes, including material, labor, and site-specific factors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate and expedite approvals from city, county, and regulatory bodies for residential zoning, building codes, and environmental compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with contractors, fabricators, architects, and internal stakeholders to align with residential project goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively resolve design, permitting, and construction challenges in real-time, adapt to dynamic field conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with facilities teams and end-users to transition residential spaces into fully operational, low-maintenance environments post-construction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in architecture, construction management, or engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of hands-on professional experience in residential architecture, engineering, construction management, or facilities development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record with residential project management and scheduling tools (e.g., Procore, Primavera, or MS Project)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on design experience in residential or technical building projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate proficiency in AutoCAD or similar CAD software for residential layouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of residential permitting processes, building codes, and environmental regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise across residential development technical disciplines, including civil/site work, structural framing, mechanical/HVAC, electrical systems, plumbing, geotechnical analysis, and surveying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing large-scale residential construction projects, including estimation and forecasting, scheduling, and subcontractor oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in reviewing, interpreting, and approving residential shop drawings, fabrication plans, blueprints, and technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in high-velocity environments, pivoting roles swiftly while sustaining urgency, precision, and results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional independent thinker and collaborative team player, with initiative, clear communication, and a bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel to various SpaceX locations for mission critical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be available to work extended hours and weekends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. Learn more about the ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/?id=ddtc_kb_article_page&amp;amp;sys_id=24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
