&lt;li&gt;Ability to take on additional responsibilities as needed as well as determine and manage priorities with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic facilities planning, technical design, or value engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient knowledge of Microsoft Office Suite and project management software/task tracking software&lt;/li&gt;
