&lt;p&gt;Starbase is expanding its site infrastructure to support ongoing operations and growth. We are seeking technicians to help build, maintain, and improve industrial facilities, utilities, and civil infrastructure across the site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame walls, floors, stairs, platforms, concrete forms, and other industrial structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construct and support various MEP projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use equipment to perform earthwork, demolition, site clearing, and cleanup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use hand and measurement tools and manual equipment (saws, squares, shovels, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support site civil and outdoor infrastructure projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Layout, installation, repair, finishing, and maintenance of structures, fixtures, and buildings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic concrete work and repair on slabs, pads, curbs, and site walkways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate forklifts, boom lifts, and other heavy equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to proper safety guidelines at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep tools, materials, and equipment in working condition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise in the selection of building materials; requisition building materials and supplies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transport various heavy materials in vehicles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION DETAILS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;u&gt;temporary&lt;/u&gt; position with SpaceX, for the length of time as stated, and is subject to change with minimal notice as business needs dictate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LENGTH OF POSITION: 3 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LOCATION: Starbase, TX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SHIFT: Must be available for all shifts (day shift, 6 AM - 6 PM or night shift, 6 PM - 6 AM), overtime and weekends as the schedule varies depending on site operational needs; flexibility is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of commercial, industrial, or civil construction experience or certificate of completion from an accredited technical program within the last 2 years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
