&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of electrical, plumbing, heating, ventilation, air conditioning and refrigeration (HVAC/R), concrete, framing, and industrial gas trade systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of basic math, engineering, and construction principles and methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, understand, and follow detailed schematics, drawings/blueprints, and instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to offer feedback to the design team to improve cost, quality, and constructability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Written and verbal communication skills; use of MS Outlook and Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced construction environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and works well with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safety training and use of forklifts, scissor lifts, and heavy equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mechanical systems, carpentry, concrete, welding, earthwork, and conduits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
