&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to pass Air Force background check for Cape Canaveral&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to provide 24x7 on-call support in emergency situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be comfortable working in a high-stress environment balancing several projects at any given time, and the flexibility to adjust for abrupt changes in strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
