&lt;li&gt;Manage the company’s and its subsidiaries’ corporate legal affairs domestically and internationally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, negotiate, and review a broad range of commercial agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the company’s stock administration team on employee stock plan documents, award agreements, and related communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support training efforts to educate internal teams on legal standards and regulatory expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross functionally with business teams across the company to analyze legal risks, devise creative solutions and develop strong, trusted advisor relationships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
