&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, information systems, or engineering discipline and 5+ years of experience in IT; OR 7+ years of professional experience with database reliability or DevOps in lieu of a degree.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;7+ years experience in monitoring and tuning databases to provide highly available and performant services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5+ years experience in optimizing SQL queries and data replication &amp;amp; transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in SQL Server and at least one other database technology (Postgres, MySQL, ClickHouse).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in resiliency and high availability methods for SQL Server, such as SQL Server log shipping, availability groups, database mirroring and replication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in scaling large critical databases with high expectations for uptime and performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively and provide technical leadership in high-stress situations such as production database outages.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of configuration management automation and limiting the amount of manual toil.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data structure design and modeling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of hardware in relation to SQL server; SAN, Virtualization, and basic networking for troubleshooting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of development cycle to interface well with developers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of adjacent database technologies (Postgres, ClickHouse, MySQL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, high degree of accuracy, excellent oral and written communication skills, strong interpersonal skills, and the ability to meet deadlines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open to learn new database technologies especially Column-oriented databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in reporting options (SQL reports, PowerBI, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of big data and data warehouse concepts and technologies.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work extended hours and weekends as needed (to respond to network and server errors after hours).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is an onsite position - remote work or hybrid work will not be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
