&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DATA CENTER TECHNICIAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join SpaceX’s IT Infrastructure team as a Data Center Technician, where you’ll play a critical role in building and maintaining multiple data centers. As a key member of our team, you’ll deploy and maintain the infrastructure that powers our mission critical systems, including servers, networks, HVAC and power systems. The ideal candidate has experience working with various types of hardware architecture and understands the strength of each.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and resolve networking, compute and rack power distribution infrastructure incidents in multiple data centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complete lifecycle for data center hardware including selection, deployment, operation, maintenance and decommission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Physically rack and cable data center equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and logically organize the physical storage of incoming data center equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality assurance testing and resolve recurring issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish, schedule and track preventative maintenance procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update documentation, including interconnect drawings, rack layouts and operation procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the environmental conditions and power/cooling systems of a data center to ensure they are optimized for servers, switches, storage arrays, and other devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain in depth quantitative performance and utilization data for detailed reporting and analytics to drive continuous improvement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the supply chain team and vendors to evaluate, procure and manage inventory of data center equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience working in a data center environment or with enterprise grade IT hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
