&lt;li&gt;Experience with solid modeling (Siemens NX) and finite element analysis software (FEMAP).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience performing closed-form and numerical stress analysis, simulations of dynamic systems, and fluid systems analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting and data analysis experience using Visual Basic, Matlab, Python, and Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
