&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation in sustainable power solutions, such as incorporating energy storage and renewable sources into permanent generation plants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop long term facility load ramps with site personnel from various teams to determine power needs across various buildings and product teams for energy procurement and utility/generation expansion&lt;/li&gt;
