&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;20108030-ffb6-4d95-872f-2889844e3ecf&quot;&gt;Manage electrical subcontractors, review work, and ensure compliance with design intent and safety standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;93f71b90-e680-428e-973c-4d9c1aa6622a&quot;&gt;Perform electrical studies including load calculations, short circuit, and arc flash analysis&lt;/li&gt;
