&lt;li&gt;Ability to work extended hours and weekends as necessary to support critical hardware, test, and production milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to vendors and other SpaceX sites as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

