&lt;li&gt;Conduct structured risk assessments of electrical systems, including Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (FMEA) and electrical hazard assessments for medium- and low-voltage distribution, classified hazardous locations, and high-energy equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate electrical incidents, near misses, shock events, and arc-flash events; drive root-cause analysis and corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
