&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Write and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;standard operating procedures (SOPs) and&amp;nbsp;demonstrate&amp;nbsp;the ability to train Production Operators and Technicians on SOPs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Assume&amp;nbsp;primary&amp;nbsp;ownership&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;area processes and&amp;nbsp;equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
