&lt;li&gt;ACLS and CPR certified&amp;nbsp;or ability to get certified within 30 days of hire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience implementing and overseeing environmental, health and safety programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience managing emergency response crews in incidents involving hazardous and non-hazardous material releases to air, soil and water as well an incidents involving technical rescue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
