&lt;p&gt;As part of the SpaceX Environmental Health &amp;amp; Safety team, you will play a pivotal role in providing technical EHS support to a wide array of launch vehicle manufacturing teams. As a tactical extension of the EHS engineering team, you will serve to reinforce safe work and work conditions for our most valuable assets, our employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform comprehensive reviews of manufacturing and test procedures and draft job hazard assessments (JHAs) to define hazard controls prior to work execution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish preventative maintenance procedures for safety-critical equipment including air monitoring devices, fall protection, respirators and more&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calibrate and service a wide array of EHS instrumentation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain records for industrial hygiene studies/remediation sampling, employee training, and work permits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify PPE requirements through in-depth hazard analysis and review of consensus agency standards (NIOSH/ANSI etc.)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functional testing of active and passive machine guarding devices in a wide array of applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform safety inspections and address deficiencies to mitigate risk&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct incident investigations and provide recommendation for corrective action&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play an active role in emergency response planning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate employee classroom safety trainings and curate relevant course content catered the teams you are supporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review lockout/tagout procedures for complex work cells and industrial machinery&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor safety equipment inventories to ensure supplies such as PPE are readily available for employees&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide supplemental environmental compliance support as required by Environmental Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
