&lt;li&gt;Perform compliance and due diligence audits in support of SpaceX environmental programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage hazardous materials and ensure all hazardous materials are labeled and stored properly in the storage areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform regular inspections such as hazardous waste accumulation and storage, universal waste storage, emergency eye wash/shower, SPCC, stormwater, industrial waste water&lt;/li&gt;
