&lt;li&gt;Provide maintenance on various equipment such as ovens, furnaces, vacuum systems, composite ply cutting machines, epoxy dispensing machines, environmental test chambers, tube-bending equipment, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to troubleshoot mechanical, electrical, and HVAC systems down to the component level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read and utilize schematics (mechanical/ electrical/pneumatic/hydraulic)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related duties, as assigned, for the purpose of ensuring an efficient and effective work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
