&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a manufacturing or production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with repairing mechanical, electrical, pneumatic, or hydraulic systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
