&lt;li&gt;Maintenance experience on gas and electric ovens, vacuum systems, environmental thermal testing, and ply cutting equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a maintenance technician or field service engineer&lt;/li&gt;
