&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for at least one of the following shifts:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1st shift: 6 AM to 6:30 PM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3rd shift: 6 PM to 6:30 AM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
