&lt;li&gt;Provide AV and conference support for onsite and offsite meetings, events, and presentations, including the technical setup for highly visible executive sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle sensitive information with discretion and confidentiality.&lt;/li&gt;
