&lt;li&gt;Manage the traffic of operational requests and follow through completing of tasks that require support from vendors SpaceX engages in continued service contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interact with tradesman, contractors and building officials to coordinate and execute maintenance repair of facilities support equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct system repairs of facilities, HVAC equipment, electrical systems, fire protection, water and plumbing infrastructure, paint, and grounds keeping&lt;/li&gt;
