&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, build, and commission fluid systems for Starship production, including test systems, manufacturing systems, and cleaning equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
