&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in fluid systems design, particularly with gases or hazardous chemicals in manufacturing or semiconductor industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience managing construction projects, design consultants, and mechanical contractors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of safety protocols for pyrophoric materials (e.g., silane) and toxic gases and chemicals (e.g., phosphine, HF)&lt;/li&gt;
