&lt;li&gt;Creativity to design for reliability, efficiency, and maintainability from a blank sheet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, iterative environment and collaborate across multidisciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
