&lt;li&gt;Ability to take initiative in a dynamic, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possession or willingness to obtain food handler&#39;s card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a high-volume output environment&lt;/li&gt;
