&lt;li&gt;Manage exceptions and disruptions in transportation operations, proactively finding solutions to minimize impact on supply chain operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders to ensure alignment and coordination across different functions, such as procurement, sales, and customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships with carriers to ensure reliable and cost-effective transportation services&lt;/li&gt;
