&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with industry trends and regulations, implementing best practices in carrier management and transport risk mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze transport data and metrics to identify areas for improvement and cost reduction&lt;/li&gt;
