&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 40%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to communicate outside of work hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work extended hours and weekends as needed to meet critical deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
