&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate outside of work hours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to travel - up to 25% travel may be required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is based in McGregor, TX, and requires being onsite full-time – hybrid and remote work will not be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
