&lt;li&gt;Standardize and automate NPI-to-mass-production processes, implement advanced inventory and WIP optimization models (including consignment and just-in-time tailored to SpaceX&#39;s build velocity), and establish clear KPIs for cost, quality, speed, yield, and resilience that are reviewed weekly with leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
