&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to establish supplier SLAs and KPIs, then track performance against key metrics such as business results delivery, cost reduction, quality, and on-time performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform market research, benchmarking, and competitive analysis for assigned categories&lt;/li&gt;
