&lt;li&gt;Drive projects from planning through implementation—scoping goals, building timelines, identifying key milestones, and managing communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to define success metrics, monitor project progress, and inform recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the HR Data team to surface and analyze trends that inform decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop and implement solutions that make HR processes more scalable, consistent, and aligned with company priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support organizational change efforts, including restructuring, realignments, and other transformation work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects align with company culture, business strategy, and compliance expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or 4+ years of experience in HR or program management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience managing or leading cross-functional projects involving HR systems, processes, or policy implementation (including, but not limited to, core HR initiatives such as performance management, onboarding, HR compliance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple complex projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and influencing skills across all levels of the business, including senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using HRIS systems and people data to inform project decisions (e.g., Workday, Tableau, Excel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of improving HR programs or processes that supported business growth or transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to simplify complex topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and shifting priorities in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail, organization, and follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training or certification in project management (e.g., PMP, Lean, Six Sigma, SQL, Power Automate)&lt;/li&gt;
