&lt;li&gt;Maintain, troubleshoot, and repair equipment and instrumentation as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and maintain hardware, high-pressure systems and pumps, and other ancillary equipment, including pneumatic components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fabricate and repair GSE hardware and equipment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design engineers to develop and document GSE activities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
