&lt;p&gt;Pay range: &lt;br&gt;Integration Technician/Level 1: $23.00 - $29.75/hour&lt;br&gt;Integration Technician/Level 2: $28.50 - $35.75/hour&lt;br&gt;Integration Technician/Level 3: $34.00 - $41.75/hour&lt;/p&gt;
