&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in business/organizational communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in internal communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in communications or public relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting change management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI tools to draft, produce, personalize, or scale communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building employee communications or engagement across multiple business units or locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impeccable writing skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly grasp and synthesize complex issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established skills in strategic and critical thinking, decision-making, negotiation, and relationship-building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized, detail-oriented, and able to thrive under deadline pressure while executing multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast-paced, dynamic, results-oriented team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert self-starter with extreme ownership; identifies what needs to be done and drives it to completion with little direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
