&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift 25 lbs. unassisted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifting, standing, climbing, bending, pulling, pushing, stooping, stretching, and carrying are generally required to perform the functions of this position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to work overtime and weekends as required to support critical milestones&lt;/li&gt;
