&lt;li&gt;Configure and troubleshoot desktop, label and large multifunction printers. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure non-traditional network attached devices (production, metrology and test machines) and interface with SpaceX infrastructure. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide 1st and 2nd, and 3rd tier support to SpaceX employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot software and hardware issues, in person and remotely. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new workflows and solutions, working directly with IT engineering groups and other internal/external resources to resolve complex issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network support and troubleshooting. From device connectivity to VLAN configuration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write instructional documentation and convey highly technical ideas in terms that non-technical people can understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
