&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design access point placements for new wireless network deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the network infrastructure team to ensure access points are deployed in the desired locations and to standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform wireless surveys to identify coverage gaps and performance concerns, and implement remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot wireless issues across a large enterprise deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and perform software and hardware updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Procure and manage wireless hardware inventory.&lt;/li&gt;
