&lt;li&gt;Support purchasing and inventory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce food quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in staff meetings focused on food safety, quality, and new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the safety of the physical kitchen and café space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a pleasant and fun environment for SpaceX employees to meet and share a meal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the delivery of in-house catering and assist with company and special events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION DETAILS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;temporary&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;position with SpaceX, for the length of time as stated, and is subject to change with minimal notice as business needs dictate.&lt;/p&gt;
