&lt;li&gt;LENGTH OF POSITION: 3 months (permanent hire conversion based on performance and business need)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LOCATION: Bastrop, TX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 years of culinary leadership experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
