&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;298&quot; data-local-id=&quot;61783fa7ac81&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;LAB ARCHITECT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;298&quot; data-local-id=&quot;61783fa7ac81&quot;&gt;The Starlink Enterprise Sales team is hiring a results-driven Lab Architect to support Starlink’s adoption around the world. Starlink brings an unprecedented opportunity to significantly impact communities, businesses, and governments worldwide. The role will focus on integrating the Starlink service with Network Vendors around the world and developing joint value propositions around the integration. This role is part of a high velocity team with extremely high expectations – this position requires deep technical and business acumen to support the Enterprise Sales team in meeting revenue targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;978&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0e143099d822&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;998&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c69bb1a5c24&quot;&gt;Drive Starlink’s integration engagements with 3rd party networking vendors with guidance/support from wider Architecture team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1144&quot; data-local-id=&quot;435c101ee004&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Starlink Marketing and 3rd party integration peers to develop joint value propositions and technical solution guides to enable customers, and internal sales/channel teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1335&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cbb5b829f562&quot;&gt;Work closely with Starlink product engineering teams to onboard completed solutions into Starlink’s internal test environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1465&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fc780ac0de09&quot;&gt;Support the technical sales engagements of the broader team, answering customer questions specific to Starlink’s 3rd party integration efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1611&quot; data-local-id=&quot;76a2dfe934e5&quot;&gt;Work in partnership with our Marketing, Licensing, Government Affairs, Finance, Legal, and Product Engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;82f7287d0c91&quot;&gt;Consult with product engineering on best practices, reference architectures, and technical guides demonstrating integration details and value proposition of Starlink&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1900&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dd3bffd452ca&quot;&gt;Represent Starlink at conferences and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1948&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2230beea6dd3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;BASIC REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f12c392d7989&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a STEM discipline or 3+ years of professional working experience in lieu of a degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2080&quot; data-local-id=&quot;505707a6f27b&quot;&gt;3+ years of professional experience in technical sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2138&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ed4bbc52df54&quot;&gt;3+ years of professional hands-on experience building and deploying enterprise network infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2243&quot; data-local-id=&quot;72c1f1636d34&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2278&quot; data-local-id=&quot;46a27ceb6578&quot;&gt;Industry recognized Computer Networking Certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2336&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6940fa6d8f37&quot;&gt;Demonstrated aptitude to learn new technical skills&lt;/li&gt;
