&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2518&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62bc521d1aee&quot;&gt;Highly detail oriented, diligent, and hard working with excellent customer interface skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2613&quot; data-local-id=&quot;78fd769509e9&quot;&gt;Coachable proficiency in one or many common domains of computer networking:
