&lt;li&gt;Network monitoring with sFlow, RFC 2544, Y.1564, TWAMP, POLQA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TCP, IPv4, IPv6, LACP, VLAN, DSCP, COS, DHCP, DNS, NAT, OSFP and BGP&lt;/li&gt;
