&lt;li&gt;Integrate process monitoring with the fabrication process to locate both welding details and machining details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and apply the fabrication process and environmental effects on large structures, such as free states, temperature swings, and weld shrinkage&lt;/li&gt;
