&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated leadership and dependability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to an extremely dynamic work environment while maintaining a positive attitude&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to find solutions to complex problems using critical thinking while drawing from previous experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain the highest level of safety on the job site and bring new ideas of how to continue to work safely and effectively in new locations and changing environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to integrate with teams that can make rapid changes and provide valuable skills to its cohesion and effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
