&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement dashboards and tools as needed for the environmental health and safety department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data related to environmental monitoring, incident reports, and safety performance to identify opportunities for data visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with teams across all sites to solicit feedback on developed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training sessions and educational materials to employees on awareness of proper usage of safety applications and visualization platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with application software teams and/or contractors to create application improvements and manage software development projects to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce specific metric reports upon request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify operational challenges within the organization, lead problem formulation, determine root cause, and implement creative and effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with different levels of the organization, including everything from layout reviews with engineers to presentations with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the operations engineers who run these systems. Set their priorities and review their work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff the team with the hiring manager, including requisitions, interviews, and leveling for operations engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear blockers and ensure redundancy across the team for consistent department and organization support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage projects and relationships with software team partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in data analytics, environmental health and safety project management, and/or environmental health and safety coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and commitment to quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proficiency with MS office, SQL databases, Excel and PowerPoint and Power BI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task, to manage shifting priorities, and to follow through on projects with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate innovative and futuristic thinking to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel regularly to U.S. SpaceX sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work extended hours and weekends for incidents, audits, and system cutovers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to walk manufacturing and industrial areas using required controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to obtain and maintain any required site or government access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. Learn more about the ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/?id=ddtc_kb_article_page&amp;amp;sys_id=24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
