&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a program across multiple sites or business units, including developing procedures, establishing performance measures, and driving consistent execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subject matter expert in Genetec Security Center, with experience in Lenel access control and/or Avigilon systems, and relevant manufacturer certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project planning and portfolio management skills, with experience coordinating internal teams, vendors, and contractors across competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using JIRA, Confluence, Microsoft Project, Smartsheet, Monday.com, or comparable project tracking and documentation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret system drawings, installation plans, wiring diagrams, and technical specifications, and to evaluate installation quality and readiness for acceptance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with preventive maintenance programs, hardware lifecycle planning, inventory management, and recurring issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing project estimates, tracking budgets, and evaluating vendor proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in space exploration, aviation, military, manufacturing, or another high-risk, high-reliability operating environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, decision-making, and relationship-building skills, with the ability to explain technical issues and delivery risks clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop technical talent, establish accountability, and keep execution on track in a fast-paced environment with changing prioriti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
