&lt;p&gt;Starlink demands a new type of supply chain. We require our suppliers to provide premium quality with rapidly evolving designs at&amp;nbsp;commercial&amp;nbsp;volumes. We are actively looking for highly motivated candidates who&amp;nbsp;possess&amp;nbsp;comprehensive knowledge of manufacturing and quality tools and have unrelenting motivation to enable suppliers for success. This position requires a combination of proven leadership and technical capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
