&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; a remote position and will require relocation if not already local to the Vandenberg, CA area&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
