&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MANAGER, INDIRECT TAX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Manager, Indirect Tax to assist in all areas of US and Canada indirect tax including monthly compliance, controversy/audit matters, tax research, planning and strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather, manipulate and review data and coordinate with external service providers to prepare sales and use tax returns, across all U.S. states and Canada&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with indirect tax audits, refund claims and coordinate responses to various tax authorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve tax notices and similar matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform tax technical research related to sales and use tax and other indirect tax matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and establish processes for audit defense&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in validating tax engine configurations and calculation results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with suppliers and internal purchasing teams on sales &amp;amp; use tax matters, including claiming various exemptions or incentives, and looking for savings opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document indirect tax issues, positions and resolutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and maintain tax calendar for indirect tax licenses, filings, as well as assist in various administrative matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with general ledger account reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validates and manages sales tax exemption certificates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement process improvements and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
