&lt;li&gt;7+ years of work experience as an indirect tax professional in public accounting or at a large multinational company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MS Excel and tax research tools (RIA Checkpoint)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sales and use tax compliance and consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple states&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with indirect tax software (Vertex/AvaTax)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with indirect taxes and their application across multiple industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
