&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is an Equal Opportunity Employer; employment with SpaceX is governed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications and will not be influenced in any manner by race, color, religion, gender, national origin/ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, mental or physical disability or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants wishing to view a copy of SpaceX’s Affirmative Action Plan for veterans and individuals with disabilities, or applicants requiring reasonable accommodation to the application/interview process should reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:EEOCompliance@spacex.com&quot;&gt;EEOCompliance@spacex.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW89423982 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW89423982 BCX0&quot;&gt;MANAGER, MATERIAL FLOW&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW89423982 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;ENGINEERING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW89423982 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(HAWTHORNE)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW89423982 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Manager, Material Flow&amp;nbsp;Engineering&amp;nbsp;is the extreme owner&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;the design and execution of&amp;nbsp;strategies&amp;nbsp;necessary to ensure seamless material availability&amp;nbsp;from supplier&amp;nbsp;to rocket.&amp;nbsp;The goal&amp;nbsp;of this role&amp;nbsp;is to achieve industry-leading inventory performance&amp;nbsp;and efficiency&amp;nbsp;through innovative&amp;nbsp;lineside&amp;nbsp;inventory&amp;nbsp;design,&amp;nbsp;material routing,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;operational excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage a multi-level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, consisting of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;salaried and hourly engineers, supervisors, technicians, and specialists&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;ing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;operations spanning nearly 24 hours per day and 7 days per week; assess employee performance, provide constructive feedback, facilitate conflict resolution,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;maintain extreme accountability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Project Collaboration:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engineering,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Operations Engineering,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leadership,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Supply Chain teams across SpaceX on critical projects to ensure stakeholder buy-in is achieved and everyone is working towards a common target state. As needed, conduct sessions to keep all cross-functional teams aligned.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Role Model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;/ Mentorship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead by setting an example, taking feedback from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;your team,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;suppliers, customers, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;all levels of the organization, motivating to achieve the highest level of results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Actively monitor and grow the workforce, ensuring team members are challenged and performing at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;expected standards; work to develop methods to motivate team members to go above and beyond the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Factory and Warehouse Layout Planning:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop and implement conceptual and detailed layouts for material flow and storage to achieve targeted inventory levels. Ensure that storage strategies are aligned across the supply chain and achieve maximum desired part density considering all available facility volume. Build and use space capacity models to ensure we have adequate storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Process Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, Improvement, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Optimization:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Design and implement innovative strategies for efficient material flow from receipt to lineside and any reverse logistics required. Understand critical part flow categories to develop specific plans that will allow production customers to achieve significant scale. Use value stream mapping to ensure end-to-end process optimization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Drive the projects and changes needed to ensure operations can maintain and scale rates year-over-year; utilize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;data analysis tools (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Grok, Claude,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Excel,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;PowerBI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, SQL, Grafana) to assess material flow performance metrics; develop and track key performance indicators.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Inventory Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Manage the incoming receipt, acceptance,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;routing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;replenishment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of a wide variety of parts and hardware into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;lineside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;inventory locations; maintain high inventory accuracy through process control and routine&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;cycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;counting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Safety&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Training&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Conduct risk assessments and implement measures to ensure that all Materials Management processes adhere to federal, state, local and SpaceX safety standards. Conduct periodic audits to ensure that unsafe conditions do not develop, all processes are being completed per design standards, and any equipment in use remains adequate for the process it supports. Develop and lead training for new processes and equipment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ensure business practices not only guarantee the storing of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in a quality manner, but also meet those needs outlined in AS9100 and customer flow-down requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Documentation and Training&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop and lead training for new processes and equipment; author comprehensive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Standard Operating Procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(SOPs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to drive standardization, consistency, and quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Adaptability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;As SpaceX continues to innovate and pave the way for future development, this manager needs to be able to adapt his/her business to the ever-changing needs of the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Advanced degree and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;+ years of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;manufacturing /&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;industrial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;experience working in one or more of the following; or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;achelor&#39;s degree and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;+ years of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;manufacturing /&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;industrial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;experience working in one or more of the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;Material&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;low&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;ngineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;Operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;Material or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;roduction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;lanning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;Distribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;/ Fulfillment / Logistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;S&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;upply&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;hain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;anagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;/ Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;Master&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;P&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;roduction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;S&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet 2&quot;&gt;cheduling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Demonstrated leadership driving projects in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;manufacturing /&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;industrial environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;2+ years of CAD experience (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;SolidWorks / NX /&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;AutoCAD) for layout planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and equipment design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;knowledge of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;tools (Grok, Claude, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Extensive analytical skills and experience with data analysis tools (Excel,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;PowerBI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, SQL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;APICS certification – CPIM or CSCP desired&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Advanced working knowledge of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;MRP, WMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, and MES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
