&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop and maintain strong relationships across disciplines, including with senior engineering, production, and supply chain leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently or collaboratively while managing multiple critical priorities and meeting deadlines in a fast-paced, loosely structured environment&lt;/li&gt;
