&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in people management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience building, leading, and managing sourcing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical understanding of datacenter compute architectures, GPUs/accelerators, CPUs, storage systems, ODM/CM models, servers, and racks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fast-paced hyperscale or AI infrastructure environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working with major compute suppliers, ODMs, and contract manufacturers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, negotiation, analytical, and cross-functional skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to secure supply and manage costs in constrained, high-demand markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for SpaceXAI’s mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel domestically and internationally as needed to support supplier relationships and critical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a dynamic environment with rapidly evolving priorities and world-class execution speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is based in Austin, TX or Palo Alto, CA, and requires being onsite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pay Range:&lt;br&gt;$155,000.00 - $215,000.00&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
