&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Pay range: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Level I: $100,000.00 - $117,500.00/per year &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Level II: $115,000.00 - $140,000.00/per year &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Your actual level and base salary will be determined on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on the following considerations: job-related knowledge and skills, education, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
