&lt;p&gt;This position supports RF filter production for SpaceX’s Starlink satellite internet constellation and growing defense communications portfolio. An Akoustis Material Handler ensures parts are in the right place at the right time to ensure smooth production operations of high-quality devices in a cleanroom environment.&lt;/p&gt;
