&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Candidate may be required to complete a pre-employment questionnaire and/or physical to confirm these capabilities, which may include a medical history review.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
