&lt;li&gt;Determining the best solution among several options, often balancing cost/schedule/complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acute attention to detail, and ability to see interactions with related systems to avoid problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrumentation and testing, data review and analysis, verification of models against reality&lt;/li&gt;
