&lt;li&gt;Experience with performance characterization of photovoltaic solar cells&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in specifying and qualifying materials and components for space flight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with design of experiments, statistical process control and process qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in analyzing mechanical assemblies using hand calculations and FEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in 3D CAD (NX preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in dynamic and thermal analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in GD&amp;amp;T&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with a wide variety of manufacturing processes and automation for composites, soft goods, adhesives and metals: welding, brazing, fastening, riveting, bonding, lamination, soldering etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
