&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;METROLOGY SPECIALIST (STARSHIP)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Starship Metrology at Starbase supports production, test, and launch by keeping measuring and test equipment tracked, issued, and in spec. This role does the day-to-day admin work for the lab: tickets, inventory, vendors, shipping, notifications, audits, and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Handle lab requests for new IMTE( Inspection, Measuring, and Test Equipment ) additions, priority calibrations, on-site scheduling, and equipment issuing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Move equipment through the normal workflow, including status updates, customer check-in support, and vendor calibration processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Keep customer inventory current and audit production-line equipment; flag equipment that is not operating or measuring correctly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Coordinate vendor POs, quotes, and invoices for repair and calibration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Send weekly overdue-asset notices to production teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Coordinate shipping for SpaceX Metrology labs and vendor labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Collect data on outsourced calibrations and in-sourcing ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Keep inventory, status, and ownership records current; help with calibration coordination, reporting, and audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Reply to customers promptly and help walk-ins; act as the admin contact for users, production teams, and vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Help with documentation and process changes; work assigned priorities and update others on progress and blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
