&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;1+ years of general admin or coordination experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Microsoft Office (Excel and Outlook)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Jira and/or Indysoft software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Calibration or inventory systems, vendor POs, shipping, or inventory control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Completing basic calibrations on gas meters and common hand tools (calipers, micrometers, tape measures, torque wrenches, crane scales, and similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Familiarity with ISO/IEC 17025, AS9100D, and ISO 9001&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Organized, detail-oriented, and able to handle several tasks and deadlines at once&lt;/li&gt;
