&lt;li&gt;3+ years of technical project management experience with US government, NASA, or commercial spacecraft entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work under pressure and deliver reliable and expeditious results across multiple parallel priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous spacecraft mission design, development, integration, and/or test experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, “can-do” attitude, self-starter, and ability to work in a high pace dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly detail-oriented, diligent, accountable, and professional with excellent written and verbal technical communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
