&lt;div data-font-name=&quot;g_d0_f1&quot; data-angle=&quot;0&quot; data-canvas-width=&quot;126&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED&amp;nbsp;SKILLS&amp;nbsp;AND&amp;nbsp;EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-font-name=&quot;g_d0_f1&quot; data-angle=&quot;0&quot; data-canvas-width=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developed, debugged, and deployed software that has been used in real world applications/project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable in containerization frameworks (Docker, K8s) and associated tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a dynamic environment with changing needs and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills both written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Linux Operating Systems and bash scripting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience with working with OSI-model layer 2 and 3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on lab experience with familiarity of spectrum analyzers, oscilloscopes, electrical power equipment and PCBAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
