&lt;li&gt;Drive hardware bring-up, debugging, documentation, manufacturing, and test of complex electronics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create simulation models of hardware to evaluate performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute towards pre-silicon verification, chip bring-up and post-silicon validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write automation software in python to interact with units under test, test equipment, instrumentation, and documentation systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide engineering support for the design, operation, improvement, and troubleshooting of facility electrical components and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge assumptions and work to find simple solutions to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
