&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience design/analysis of circuits, electronic products, or hardware (internships/co-ops and club projects can apply)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduating in the class of 2026 or 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing mixed-signal circuit boards using processors, FPGAs, Ethernet, multi-GHz Serdes, DRAM interfaces (DDR4), I2C, SPI, operational amplifiers, analog to digital and digital to analog converters, and power supply components&lt;/li&gt;
