&lt;p&gt;As an Onboarding Specialist, your contributions will ensure the Onboarding Team can consistently provide high-quality social and developmental experiences to all new SpaceX employees. Your efforts will ensure we can maximize the Onboarding Team&#39;s impact on new hires, helping them become great SpaceX employees quickly. We are looking for someone detail-oriented and outcome-focused. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage and scale the company’s domestic onboarding&amp;nbsp;program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design, development, implementation, evaluation, and continuous improvement of orientation and&amp;nbsp;onboarding&amp;nbsp;programs with innovative strategies and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across the company to update all new hire information for current company practices and policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and act on a deep understanding of internal onboarding-related systems (Workday, Jira, Greenhouse, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track metrics to evaluate the effectiveness of&amp;nbsp;onboarding&amp;nbsp;programs, then develop and execute recommendations for program improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in weekly orientation preparations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide outstanding service to our customers by responding in a timely manner to their questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement positive employee experiences to help new SpaceX employees adapt to company and team cultures quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR leadership to create and implement impactful onboarding-related resources for hiring managers, company leadership, and other stakeholders in the onboarding process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of professional experience in onboarding, learning and development, human resources, or program management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of organization and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading projects from inception to implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong multi-tasking and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn quickly on the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of self-motivation, initiative, and sense of urgency to get things done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and flexibility; the ability to work in a dynamic organization with rapidly changing needs&lt;/li&gt;
