&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside internal teams to uncover their needs and design technical approaches that closely align with their goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the main technical point of contact, supporting end-to-end while coordinating with internal teams to ensure strong outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build prototypes and proof-of-concept applications that clearly illustrate effective ways to integrate with Spok/Grok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on system-on-system architecture and support teams in developing advanced applications powered by LLMs – Large Language Models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep current evolving LLM technologies, best practices, and the tools commonly used in fast-moving environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a STEM or engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience working in engineering or operations/process development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience supporting cross- functional teams and a solid grasp of their fast-paced environment, limited resources, and specific pain points, specifically in engineering disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to code along with a track record of developing production-level applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with shipping real-world applications using large language models and related machine learning tools to lead cross-functional groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of common LLM techniques including prompt design, evaluation methods, agent systems, and retrieval architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working with AI product design, development, integration, and/or test&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work under pressure and deliver expeditious results across multiple parallel priorities&lt;/li&gt;
