&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OPERATIONS ENGINEER (STARSHIELD)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Starshield is a satellite development program focused on efforts in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Earth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;observation, communications, and hosted payloads that enable innovation in national security efforts.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As the Starshield constellation grows, so must the critical ground assets that support the constellation. The Ground Infrastructure team is looking for engineers &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;who &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;can own strategic planning, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;align &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;resources &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;tasks, and optimize ground fleet operations. This role will require you to apply principles of operations engineering and data science to steer strategic decisions and accelerate team output. The ideal candidate is self-starting, eager to tackle a wide breadth of engineering problems, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;able to fit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;seamlessly &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;into multi-disciplinary teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Standardize how work is requested, planned, executed, and closed across all deployed ground infrastructure. Own &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;work &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;orders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, work instructions, and work documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide engineering support for new infrastructure deployments and repairs to existing assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Automate repetitive reliability tasks that scale with infrastructure expansion to reduce operational burden&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
