&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to stand for long durations and work directly with hardware on the floor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to stoop and bend when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift/carry up to 25lbs (unassisted) for 1-2 hours per day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel and work long hours or weekends when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

