&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Must be able to work onsite at Starbase, TX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Must be available to provide on-call support for critical plant events and work extended hours or weekends as operational needs require&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ability to work in industrial environments, including outdoors in heat, cold, and rain, at heights or in confined spaces when necessary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ability to wear required personal protective equipment and safely access operating equipment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel to vendor facilities or other project sites as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
