&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel on short notice (up to 30% of the time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively operate in extreme outdoor environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to occasionally stand in a static position for extended periods&lt;/li&gt;
