&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assemble, install, and repair pipes, fittings, heating, water, and drainage systems according to specifications and plumbing codes&lt;/li&gt;
