&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering, facilities, and project teams to align power project scope with SpaceXSI&#39;s operational needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with vendors and contractors to support equipment procurement, installation schedules, and compliance with SpaceXSI&#39;s technical and safety standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the facilities team with real estate matters for power project sites, such as identifying prospective properties, supporting lease and acquisition work, dispositions (terminations and subleases/assignments), and related site-control matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support legal, finance, and other departments on real estate and project transactions, including tracking terms and conditions, payment status, and required document and information delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help forecast and plan for future power capacity needs to support SpaceXSI&#39;s growing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
