&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience designing circuits, electronic products, or hardware (internship and project team experience is applicable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
