&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Aptitude to work as part of a team and also independently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of production line bring-up, the work schedule for this position will evolve over time:&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
