&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Starlink, our revolutionary satellite constellation, is delivering low-latency broadband internet worldwide. We are committed to offering access to high-speed internet to customers around the world, providing a world class experience of Starlink for all users. You will join the Growth team that is responsible for launching, growing, and improving Starlink across its global reach. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; The Starlink Product Growth Strategy &amp;amp; Analytics Lead will be responsible for identifying new growth opportunities &amp;amp; scaling successful initiatives in key markets around the world. Projects typically entail developing new offerings, business models, and channels&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end playbook for rolling out new products, offerings, and growth initiatives – from initial strategy to post-launch optimization&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess consumer insights and analytics to identify winning &amp;amp; losing demand generation approaches&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development and execution of strategic programs (e.g., campaigns, new channels) to maximize global sales for a product category&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research industry and competitive landscapes – telecom, consumer tech, and beyond – to sharpen how Starlink positions, prices, and packages its offering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate and drive product improvements across the business by working with key stakeholders including Finance, Platform Software, Design, Product Engineering, Marketing, Country Growth, and Customer Support &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of cumulative work experience in management consulting, growth strategy, go-to-market planning, or business operations experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience using&amp;nbsp;Excel for&amp;nbsp;data analysis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; 3+ years of management consulting, growth strategy, go-to-market planning, or business operations experience &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experiencing using SQL&amp;nbsp;and/or Python&amp;nbsp;for data analysis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years in early and growth stage startups working with lean teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distinctive business judgment and communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent project management, problem solving and analysis skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience analyzing data, identifying insights, and developing creative approaches to solving problems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex operational and strategic initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry experience in telecom, technology, consumer products, automotive, and/or maritime&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
