&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support&amp;nbsp;factory activation,&amp;nbsp;new product introductions, line expansions, and facility&amp;nbsp;upgrades; contribute to strategic decision-making for foundry design and bringing the facility online&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure a strong focus is placed on safety and maintain an excellent safety record&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create&amp;nbsp;and enforce&amp;nbsp;training and career development paths to&amp;nbsp;ensure timely product delivery,&amp;nbsp;boost&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;quality,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;reduction in&amp;nbsp;lead time/cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
