&lt;li&gt;Technical knowledge and skills in coding and computer applications (e.g. MS Office Suite, VBA, Smartsheet, SQL, Confluence, JIRA, Power BI, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of implementing continuous improvement efforts, ideally using problem solving frameworks including lean principles, six sigma, or Kaizen concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading multi-disciplinary and cross-functional teams working on strategic problems.&lt;/li&gt;
