&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work a large percentage of the day in a cleanroom with strict adherence to Class 100 level gowning protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in an environment requiring strict adherence to workplace safety rules, where additional PPE is required in certain circumstances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to work extended hours and weekends as needed to meet critical milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position will sit 100% onsite in our Canandaigua, NY facility. Remote work not considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aptitude to work as part of a team and also independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
