&lt;p&gt;Pay range: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Production Supervisor: $100,000.00 - $135,000.00/per year &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Your actual level and base salary will be determined on a case-by-case basis and may vary based on the following considerations: job-related knowledge and skills, education, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
