&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional experience in a manufacturing, production, or logistics environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience leading a team or project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean manufacturing training and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience monitoring, tracking, and continually improving total cost equation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with applying lean manufacturing principles and efficiency methods&lt;/li&gt;
