&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience working in a production, mechanical, or manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of test experience in a manufacturing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate&#39;s degree in a technical or engineering field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with root cause/corrective action systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, proactive, and experience managing multiple priorities and tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience working within quality management systems (ISO 9001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
