&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership project management skills and experience, and effective communication of technical concepts across multi-disciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with liquid rocket engines, spacecraft systems, and/or pressurized fluid systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in design for manufacturability (DFM), with demonstrable success at taking products through development, testing, and production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
