&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Documentation and configuration management experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Experience writing test plans, procedures and providing go/no-go judgment and rationale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Experience taking products through development cycle to full volume production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
