&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Experience with NX (UG or equivalent) CAD and geometric dimensioning and tolerancing (GD&amp;amp;T) for component and tooling design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
