&lt;li&gt;Perform work according to procedures, specifications and test instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate machinery such as DAVI roll former, automated tig welding machine, hydro-forming sheet metal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run automated machines for surface preparation or thermal barrier coating applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read and interpret technical drawings and follow detailed work instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use precision calibrated tools – torque wrenches, micrometers and calipers.&lt;/li&gt;
