&lt;li&gt;Operate forklifts, cranes and heavy equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform blending, filing and shearing of sheet metal piece parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean tools, valves, regulators and maintain a professional and neat work area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage, install, set-up, test and de-tool Thrust Chamber Assemblies and subassemblies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot engines and cell systems.&lt;/li&gt;
