&lt;li&gt;Basic computer skills, including experience using Microsoft Office and photo generation/compilation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with crane and lift operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of vacuum systems&lt;/li&gt;
