&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of different fittings such as NPT, MS, and A/N and Swagelok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability in reading/understanding technical manuals and reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, and understand operating system schematics and drawings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use of precision measuring instruments/equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills for relaying data (verbally and in-writing) between other employees and customers&lt;/li&gt;
