&lt;li&gt;Experience with lean manufacturing and 5S organizational methods&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using digital borescopes for visual inspection&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mathematical, basic computer, problem solving and decision-making skills, and strong written and verbal communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently or as part of a team to meet aggressive schedules&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate and understand readouts on automated asset user interfaces and hydrostatic proof booth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
