&lt;li&gt;Real Estate experience with NASA, United States Space Force, or other government agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real Estate Paralegal certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Word, Outlook, Excel, and PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Archibus and ArcGIS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task, prioritize, work in cross-functional teams, perform under tight deadlines, and establish/maintain internal and external professional relationships&lt;/li&gt;
