&lt;li&gt;Engage throughout the whole software development lifecycle of services -- from inception to design, deployment, operation, and iterative refinement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on performance bottlenecks and performance improvement techniques&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
