&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-time or embedded systems development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with libraries such as QT, Boost, VTK, CUDA, or build tools like CMake&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with microcontrollers, FPGAs, or hardware-software integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in manufacturing systems, controls software, or additive manufacturing processes (laser powder bed fusion or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
