&lt;li&gt;Front-end experience in Blazor, Angular, React, or similar JavaScript framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SECS/GEM semiconductor manufacturing automationDeep understanding of version control, testing, continuous integration, build, deployment &amp;amp; monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
