&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree and 5+ years of experience working in one or more of the following; OR 9+ years of experience working in one or more of the following in lieu of a degree:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
