&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic sourcing/capital equipment procurement experience, ideally in energy, industrial gas, or heavy manufacturing environments, with a track record of managing multi-million-dollar CAPEX purchases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience sourcing cryogenic systems and related capital equipment (storage tanks, vacuum-jacketed piping, cryogenic pumps, vaporizers, valves, and transfer systems for LOX, LN2, LCH4, or LH2).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven background procuring power generation and electrical capital equipment, including generators, turbines, switchgear, transformers, UPS systems, and related balance-of-plant infrastructure for large facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading end-to-end sourcing for complex capital projects: RFP/RFQ development, total cost of ownership analysis, competitive bidding, contract negotiation, supplier qualification, and long-term vendor performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing air separation units (ASUs) to support liquid oxygen and nitrogen production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing specialized, vacuum-insulated pressure vessels (tanks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing power generation equipment (gas turbines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read technical drawings and work with engineering BOMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge and skills in current technologies and applications (e.g., MS Office Suite, SQL, Power BI, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical procurement or manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with experience presenting to executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in ambiguity, with a bias for action and in a startup-like culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remarkable problem-solving skills with a bias for speed and positive impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
