&lt;li&gt;Direct construction project management experience and/or construction cost estimating experience on large industrial, commercial, or data center projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity or experience in purchasing or similar procurement related to construction and capital equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in industrial engineering, construction management, facilities management, or hyperscale / enterprise data center delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong budget tracking and cost analytical skills on large capital programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive project management and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale industrial, commercial, or data center construction projects (preferably $50M+ packages)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong contract negotiation and document management skills (AIA, or similar; equipment T&amp;amp;Cs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remarkable problem-solving skills with a bias for speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick learner and ability to prioritize appropriately to meet aggressive data center delivery timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent customer service skills with internal construction and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written, verbal, and presentation communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge and skills in current technologies and applications (e.g. MS Office Suite, SQL, PowerBI, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to conduct all activities with the highest degree of integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, self-motivated and able to respond quickly to a fast-moving and ever-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
