&lt;li&gt;Effective written, verbal and presentation communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge and skills in current technologies and applications (e.g. MS Office Suite, SQL, PowerBI,&amp;nbsp;etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
