&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is a high-profile, cross functional position that plays an integral role in enabling development and production flow of satellites. Working in close coordination with engineering and manufacturing departments, sourcing specialists execute effective creative and smart supply chain strategies to achieve production goals. The functions within the supply chain management include material requirements planning, delivery management, dock-to-stock coordination, and inventory management. With integration taking place in-house, sourcing specialists are able to see their assemblies come to life every day!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
