&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree and 6+ years of experience working in one or more of the following; or 9+ years of experience working in one or more of the following in lieu of a degree:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply Chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW192901697 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in global supply chain, commodity management, or electronics sourcing with a focus on datacenter power distribution, PDUs, busbars, or rack-level electrical components&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical understanding of rack-level power electronics: intelligent PDUs, busbar systems, OCP Open Rack / ORv3 power architectures, 48V DC distribution, rack ATS/STS, power monitoring, and environmental sensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record sourcing electrical commodities at hyperscale, in server/rack OEM environments, or at PDU / busbar / power-electronics suppliers (e.g. Vertiv, Eaton, Schneider, Rittal, busbar specialists)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with electrical drawings, single-line diagrams, UL/IEC certification, firmware/telemetry on intelligent PDUs, and the difference between rack-level vs. facility-level electrical scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience at hyperscalers, leading ODMs, Tier-1 CMs, or AI infrastructure companies with aggressive scaling demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success negotiating complex SOWs, challenging specifications and costs, and delivering results in ambiguous, high-velocity environments with extreme timelines and massive scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reading technical drawings, data sheets, BOMs, and related files; comfort partnering with electrical and mechanical engineers on specification trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation, analytical, project management, and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with commodity management, roadmap planning, and approved vendor list processes in a manufacturing context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for SpaceX&#39;s mission and excitement about enabling the fastest AI infrastructure builds on Earth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
