&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoListParagraph&quot;&gt;Create sourcing strategies for assigned category (including Equipment, Services, MRO, and custom parts to reduce risk and meet targets for the supply chain department including, but not limited to, payment terms, cash targets, continuity of supply, and cost savings&lt;/li&gt;
