&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn quickly and prioritize appropriately to meet customer and company needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written and verbal communications skills, with strong ability to communicate complex ideas to an audience with a wide range of technical or product expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, self-motivated and able to respond quickly to a fast-moving and ever-changing environment. Proven capability to prioritize multiple on-going projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MRP or enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems, and with managing bill of materials, work orders, and purchase orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with forecasting, demand planning, and lead time analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of common manufacturing processes and machines including mills, lathes, forgings, castings, heat treatment, coatings, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in data analysis using Excel, SQL and PowerBI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
