&lt;li&gt;Resolves design and construction conflicts in the field in real time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes on new projects ad-hoc as the business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and works autonomously and efficiently in a dynamic team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
