&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Portfolio demonstrating built work in both interior/spatial design and graphic design. Applications submitted without a portfolio will not be considered&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
