&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. AI Engineer on Special Programs Supercomputing you will build the tooling, and work with our cleared engineers at classified sites execute it. The quality of what you build directly determines how effectively those engineers can operate in environments where they cannot call you for help. Your tooling must be deterministic, complete, well-tested, and foolproof.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-font-name=&quot;g_d0_f1&quot; data-angle=&quot;0&quot; data-canvas-width=&quot;195.92833333333328&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
