&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and optimize DFT architectures, including scan insertion, compression/decompression logic, memory BIST, and logic BIST, leveraging Siemens Tessent tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration and verification of Design for Test (DFT) IPs and fabrics within Subsystems&lt;/li&gt;
