&lt;li&gt;Experience with design,&amp;nbsp;programming&amp;nbsp;and commissioning of&amp;nbsp;industrial&amp;nbsp;robotic&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;(e.g.&amp;nbsp;Kuka, ABB, or Fanuc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PLC programming in SCL with&amp;nbsp;Beckhoff TwinCat 3&amp;nbsp;or Siemens TIA Portal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, C#, C++, or&amp;nbsp;similar&amp;nbsp;high level programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing machine vision systems&amp;nbsp;for inspection applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;electrical knowledge and experience troubleshooting&amp;nbsp;electrical systems&amp;nbsp;using tools like multimeters and oscilloscopes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience configuring and debugging networks and fieldbus systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with motion system sizing and implementation (gantries, robotics, conveyance, motors, actuators, pneumatics/hydraulics, sensor selection/integration, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industry standards such as IEC, NFPA, NEC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
