&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;9cbf98a9-472b-4ceb-83b4-f68fd133c613&quot;&gt;Position may involve extended hours and weekend work as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;8db93e15-6bfd-4421-9cdd-8f24bafdf0d1&quot;&gt;This position may require travel between&amp;nbsp;various SpaceX sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

