&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science in Engineering, Occupational Health &amp;amp; Safety, Construction&amp;nbsp;Management, or related field (emphasis in Construction Safety preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience, preferably in construction safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strong organizational and communication skills with a clear aptitude and desire to influence people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience leading multi-site or multi-contractor construction safety programs in high-risk or complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
