&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work cross-functionally and build strong relationships with other business groups and/or clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work both collaboratively and independently in a fast-paced and constantly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
