&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in electrical engineering or other engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience with hardware development or electronics test engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in electrical engineering or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of analog control and discrete logic design&lt;/li&gt;
