&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of basic computer applications; ability to easily navigate through different computer software programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create and update RFPOs and facilities work orders in an ERP software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
