&lt;li&gt;Excellent academic record at a top-tier law school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant knowledge of and experience with establishing and managing global intellectual property programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with technology and the ability to interact with highly technical engineers&lt;/li&gt;
