&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, engineering, math, or scientific discipline and 5+ years of systems engineering experience; OR 7+ years of professional experience building software in lieu of a degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience with client and server hardware/software, management tools, enterprise networking, virtualization, and security technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience building, deploying and troubleshooting Linux systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a scripting language (Bash, Python) to automate and solve reoccurring tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, deploying and troubleshooting HPC clusters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cluster resource managers (Slurm, PBS, LSF)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring and alerting technologies (Prometheus, Grafana, Nagios)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scientific and engineering computing (CFD, FEA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with large scale AI training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GPU usage in a compute cluster and Cuda&lt;/li&gt;
