&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting global investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting investigations in a manufacturing and/or engineering setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with e-discovery and/or pulling electronic records and files.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate with a diverse range of partners (e.g., HR, IT, Security, Legal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to be empathetic and to provide emotional support while also gathering facts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a variety of electronic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to grasp complex technical concepts quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
