&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Thorough understanding of signal and power integrity fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Substrate design experience for RF, digital, high-speed and mixed signal die&lt;/li&gt;
