&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with OSHA, Cal/OSHA, and other applicable regulations while driving beyond-compliance performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver training programs for employees and leadership on industrial hygiene topics.&lt;/li&gt;
