&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is looking for an experienced Network Automation Engineer to build the tools that support a large and growing network infrastructure, including live data center build environments. This employee will be a member of the IT Network Engineering team, which is responsible for maintaining a stable, reliable, and diverse network. This network supports the design, manufacturing, and launching of rockets, spacecraft, satellites, and human spaceflight. The ideal candidate will be a great communicator, able to document their work, excel at multi-tasking, and enjoy a fast-paced high-tech environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build network automation tools to support switch configurations, config backups, software updates, logging, monitoring, and alerting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create Python scripts to automate manual network processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure, maintain, and improve the uptime and performance of the network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as technical product owner for infrastructure tools and software used by the network engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale networks with automation and operational improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with network engineers to create operable and maintainable infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide mentorship to junior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in electrical engineering, computer engineering, or other STEM discipline and 5+ years of professional network automation, network engineering, or site reliability engineering experience; OR 8+ years of network automation experience and high school diploma or equivalency certificate in lieu of a degree.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking protocols and traffic types: TCP, IPv4/IPv6, voice, video, broadcast, and streaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux operating systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation in Python, Go, shell, bash, and/or other languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source control tools such as Git or Subversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing hundreds to thousands of network assets in an automated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Puppet, Ansible, or other automation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run projects independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of fundamental networking.&lt;/li&gt;
