&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of&amp;nbsp;enabling human life on Mars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SR. MANAGER, FACILITY INTEGRATION (REGULATORY)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Manager, Facility Integration will be integrating all applicable regulatory, permitting and jurisdictive actions into a cohesive master plan for all interests in the greater Memphis area. This position will work with established SpaceXSI personnel and ensure compliance supporting new and existing projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate new regulatory programs, working with established personnel and resources within the company to ensure on-site compliance is achieved prior to, during, and after construction of new projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate all existing permitting on site, working with established personnel and resources within the company to document, complete, and archive existing permitting and site planning documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance consists of local, state, and federal requirements; including but not limited to environmental, building code, real estate/ zoning, and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support master planning efforts on site to ensure new developments are scaled correctly and efficiently to meet company goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop efficient tools for reporting and auditing site compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in engineering or a regulatory field including civil, architectural, environmental, or legal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of professional experience in regulatory compliance and site planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a construction environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in super intelligence usage in the workplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background and familiarization with supercomputer construction or major construction projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in local regulatory compliance landscape in Tennessee and Mississippi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for SpaceX&#39;s mission and goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle many projects at once, prioritize work, and work efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly self-motivated and able to prioritize and execute tasks in a high-pressure environment with ongoing drive for continuous improvement in all aspects of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to work onsite in Memphis, no remote work will be allowed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility required for long hours and weekend work when necessary to support operations and critical project timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to be active and mobile on construction sites; must be able to navigate rapidly changing terrain and able to lift 35lbs+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
