&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Conduct applied research on single crystal (SX), directionally solidified (DS), and equiaxed (EQ) cast components for gas turbines, focusing on the relationship between casting processes, material properties, and component performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Investigate casting processes and process parameters to improve material quality, reliability, and manufacturability. These processes include core manufacturing, wax pattern manufacturing, shelling, solidification, core leaching, heat treat, HIP, machining, and coating methods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Design and conduct experiments to evaluate casting processes, identify defects, and assess potential process improvements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Analyze cast component failures arising during manufacturing or service, collaborating with design and process engineers to investigate underlying causes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Conduct root cause investigations using fractography, metallography, and materials characterization techniques&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Evaluate material selection, material forms, tooling approaches, and material and process specifications to inform component design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Develop and execute experimental test plans to characterize material properties and evaluate the performance of castings and foundry processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams, technicians, and external technical partners to exchange research findings and evaluate their practical application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Document experimental methods, analyze results, and present recommendations to improve component performance, efficiency, durability, and manufacturability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
