&lt;li&gt;Experience with CAD and FEA software packages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience with mechanical/electromechanical design, analysis, testing, and/or manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
