&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SR. NETWORK SECURITY ENGINEER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is looking for a Sr. Network Security Engineer to design, implement, and operate security for SpaceX corporate and enterprise networks. This is hands-on network security work: designing and implementing segmentation, routing, and access controls; operating firewalls and related platforms such as Palo Alto, Check Point, Juniper, and Arista; and turning operational requirements into production architectures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and support network security for corporate and enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and maintain network security controls, policies, and architectures based on operational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide subject matter expertise on network security, firewalls, and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze operational needs that present security challenges and develop secure network solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain network segmentation, routing, and access controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design reviews for network security changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define network security patterns and standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an escalation point for network security issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive network security incidents to root cause and a durable fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with network engineering, IT, and other SpaceX teams to determine functional needs, develop secure architectures, and communicate security best practices and policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and implement changes in a production environment with change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a STEM field and 5+ years of network security experience; OR 8+ years of network security experience in lieu of a degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience securing networks, IT infrastructure, applications, endpoints, and/or APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
