&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in materials science, mechanical engineering, or similar discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in microelectronics device research or manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
