&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hardware, robotics, automation, or manufacturing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing tooling, fixtures, or jigs for assembly or test applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to scripting or data analysis tools (e.g. MATLAB, JMP, or equivalent) for process data analysis or automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with precision assemblies, robotic systems, or automated pick-and-place equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with manufacturing process development methodologies (e.g., PFMEA, process capability studies, SPC)&lt;/li&gt;
