&lt;p&gt;At SpaceX, we are committed to ensuring the service remains a force for good and sustains trust worldwide: both connecting the unconnected and executing thorough processes to detect and prevent misuse by illicit operators. We are looking for an experienced Sr. Platform Integrity Analyst, known internally as Sr. Customer Integrity &amp;amp; Threat Detection Analyst to detect, disrupt, and investigate potential misuse of the service—including proactively combating and deterring illicit operators. This person must strike the careful balance of safeguarding customer information and privacy while applying enforcement measures and executing with an even-handed approach, avoiding overreach and disproportionate collateral impacts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;and assess platform integrity and abuse risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop&amp;nbsp;technical detection and&amp;nbsp;mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React to investigate potential issues such as&amp;nbsp;scams, fraud, and illicit goods/activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;deepen our relationships with them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct periodic reviews to support legal and compliance obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute with consideration for customer privacy, targeting activities of indisputable harm and avoiding overreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;4+ years of professional experience in global affairs, intelligence, or investigations;&amp;nbsp;OR 6+ years&amp;nbsp;of professional experience in global affairs, intelligence, or investigations in lieu of a degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience with data querying languages (e.g., SQL), scripting languages (e.g., Python),&amp;nbsp;geospatial tools (e.g., ArcGIS),&amp;nbsp;and/or statistical software (e.g., R)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience investigating, mitigating, or dealing with illicit operators (e.g., fraud, abuse,&amp;nbsp;cybersecurity,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;illicit activities)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical research and communication skills, including excellent written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
