&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in an engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with strategic technology decision making and designing state-of-the-art telecommunication networking infrastructure and feature roadmaps with an operator or vendor setting&lt;/li&gt;
