&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in electrical engineering or other engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional RF experience with antennas or communication systems (internship and extracurricular experience is applicable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years professional experience with radio test equipment such as spectrum analyzers, vector signal analyzers, vector signal generators, and network analyzers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional programming experience in Python, C#, C++, or MATLAB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
