&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel approximately 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to work extended hours or/and weekends as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is based in Washington, DC and requires being onsite – remote work not considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

