&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, math, or an engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in software development, developing applications in languages such as Python, C++, or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with automated testing of hardware in the loop (HITL) or hardware out of the loop (HOOTL) software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with test automation and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
