&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree and 2+ years of experience working in one or more of the following; or 3+ years of experience working in one or more of the following:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
