&lt;li&gt;APICS certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lean Six Sigma certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written, verbal and presentation communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, self-motivated and able to respond quickly to a fast-moving and ever-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to conduct all activities with the highest of integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of block-chain powered supply chain platforms to boost efficiency, traceability, and transparency&lt;/li&gt;
