&lt;p&gt;We are partnering with airlines, aircraft operators, airports, and aviation service providers to deliver connectivity that matches or exceeds terrestrial standards for ground operations and passenger-facing facilities. We’re seeking tenacious, commercially sharp sales professionals who excel at hunting and closing deals to help reshape the realities of airport infrastructure. This is a rare opportunity to create meaningful change and apply your world-class sales skills on the world’s leading aviation connectivity team.&lt;/p&gt;
