&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;SpaceX is seeking a Senior Treasury Analyst to join the Treasury team, ensuring that our treasury capabilities meet the increasing needs of our rapidly growing global Starlink business. The role will own various aspects of treasury operations, with a primary focus on global cash management, country expansions, foreign exchange operations, treasury systems, controls, and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Build and maintain the company’s expanding worldwide banking network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Develop robust analytics and reports to help optimize treasury processes and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Research and resolve inquiries regarding global cash activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Support accounting, finance, tax, legal, FP&amp;amp;A, operations, and other internal teams with projects and initiatives relating to cash, bank accounts, and treasury activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Reconcile bank accounts, monitor banking fees, executing letters of credit, and initiating external payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Ownership of internal banking controls (maintain segregation of duties controls, user access reviews, compliance with authorized signers, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Navigate and find improvement opportunities for SpaceX&#39;s evolving banking landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Play an important role in building best-in-class treasury infrastructure to support Starlink&#39;s global expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;4+ years of corporate treasury or treasury operations banking experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
