&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement physical layer (PHY) algorithms for satellite-based 4G/5G (LTE/NR) eNodeB/gNodeB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop optimized signal processing algorithms running on resource-constrained CPUs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop models and run simulations to analyze and validate overall system performance, including modem performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, test, maintain, and document the wireless PHY and MAC layers of the protocol stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and debug complex performance issues across the wireless PHY and MAC layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architecture, design, and code reviews. Contribute to system dimensioning and algorithm design for next generation hardware.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
