&lt;li&gt;5+ Years of experience with at least 1 of the following: wireless signal processing, modem systems design, wireless systems engineering, DSP (digital signal processing), or physical layer processing (L1).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ Years of C/C++ coding experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
