&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with Linux command line use, git-based version control, and python programming.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;SDR (software defined radio) experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience supporting products through the full release cycle including commercial deployment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong skills in debugging and performance optimization; exceptional analytical skills and engineering fundamentals.&lt;/div&gt;
