&lt;p&gt;Build, test, and repair Starlink hardware used on aircraft. The Starlink Aviation team makes the systems that connect planes to the Starlink network and support the in-flight experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
