&lt;li class=&quot;py-1 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:inline&quot; data-streamdown=&quot;list-item&quot;&gt;Install and repair Starlink enterprise and aviation products to FAA, quality, and workmanship standards&lt;/li&gt;
