&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;As a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;Customer Success Manager, Africa, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;you will own a book of existing reseller customers and be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt; growing the business with them. You will build strong commercial relationships, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;identify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt; opportunities to expand their use of Starlink, and work through the issues that stand in the way of growth. This includes pricing, capacity, billing, payment, activation, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;logistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;, and product needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
