&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Latin America, including multi-country accounts, local billing or tax, regulation, or selling through partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with telecommunications, satellite, networking, backhaul, or similar infrastructure sold to carriers, ISPs, or enterprise customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of growing revenue inside existing accounts, such as expansion, additional sites, or new ways the customer uses the product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
