&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;Starlink is delivering high-speed, low-latency internet around the world. After a deal is signed, Customer Success gets the service on,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt; activated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;, billed, and growing. Customer Success Managers own the customer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt; relationship&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt; and the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;revenue &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;growth plan. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;Customer Success &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;Specialists own &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt;activations and billing, from a signed contract order to a working account.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
