&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pay range:&lt;br&gt;Account Director: $180,000.00 - $260,000.00/per year&lt;/p&gt;
