&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability to work extended hours and weekends as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel approximately 50% of the time to customer locations, partner sites, and other SpaceX locations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
