&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated history of achieving definitive, measurable outcomes through political or community engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on issues directly related to corporate community relations&lt;/li&gt;
