&lt;li&gt;Ability to champion and lead significant cross-functional projects and business initiatives, including ability to manage in an environment with competing priorities and limited resources&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional external interface and public speaking skills, including excellent written and verbal communication skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful internal communicator within SpaceX that possesses the ability to tailor communications appropriately to level (working-level to executive-level)  &lt;/li&gt;
