&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to determine what projects to pursue that have positive social and economic development potential as well as are smart business decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate risk and ambiguity successfully&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
