&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with maintenance manager to perform full spectrum analysis on asset reliability improvement opportunities, such as suggesting improved preventative maintenance actions, identification of design flaws, with a top down approach to maintenance demand driver reduction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of technicians through daily repairs, preventative maintenance actions, complex continuous improvement projects, to ensure maximum asset availability for Starbase manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage weekly workload distribution and technician task assignments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage of incoming maintenance requests from internal customers, and effectively resource manage priority workload with all available resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with third-party vendors for parts acquisition, asset documentation standards, training, and on-site maintenance actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert in equipment maintenance troubleshooting, mechatronics, project management, team key performance indicator analysis, manufacturing key performance indicator analysis, 5S and LEAN manufacturing strategies, and high-level people leadership in a fast-paced highly iterative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a diverse technician team to troubleshoot and repair control and electrical system failures involving – PLCs, HMIs, servomotors, servo amplifiers, input/output, field sensors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a diverse technician team to troubleshoot and repair various machine hydraulic and pneumatic systems – actuators, valves, pumps, filters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a diverse technician team to troubleshoot and repair automated tool mechanical systems – ballscrews, linear rails, guideways, gearboxes, 3 phase motors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide developmental leadership to a team of technicians, facilitating training and advancement of skills, to maintain cutting edge aerospace technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related duties, as assigned, for the purpose of ensuring an efficient and effective work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
