&lt;p&gt;The Starlink Precision Machining team machines and delivers single digit micron tolerance and difficult-to-source parts at production volumes. The&amp;nbsp;2nd&amp;nbsp;shift&amp;nbsp;Precision Machining Supervisor will drive a culture of quality while developing exceptional&amp;nbsp;Machinists, Quality Specialists, and Technicians. As a technical leader, the Precision Machining Supervisor will&amp;nbsp;meet customer rate demands, proactively identify and resolve production schedule issues, continuously develop and improve production processes, and inspire the team to achieve consistent machining excellence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
