&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret drawings and weld symbols per AWS A2.4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AWS D1.1, D1.6, and D1.2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aluminum gas tungsten arc welding (GTAW) and gas metal arc welding (GMAW) experience&lt;/li&gt;
