&lt;p&gt;The Surveillance Operator is responsible for the real-time surveillance of camera systems, rapid response to security alerts, and dispatching of personnel. This role serves as a critical first line of defense in maintaining situational awareness and ensuring timely response to incidents across the facility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
