&lt;li&gt;Dispatching: Coordinate and dispatch security officers, maintenance teams, emergency services, or other responders as needed using radio, phone or dispatch systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident Command: Assume incident command for security events until relieved by higher authority; provide clear direction, gather critical information and coordinate response efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document all incidents, alarms, dispatches and actions taken in the incident management system with accuracy and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain constant communication with field teams, supervisors and other departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and report system malfunctions, camera outages, or technical issues to the appropriate support team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow all standard operating procedures, post orders and emergency response protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain confidentiality and professionalism at all times while handling sensitive security information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
