&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with subject matter experts to design and develop engaging content for a variety of audiences and delivery modes (online, classroom, etc.) with clear strategies and tactics to achieve desired learning outcomes, including but not limited to: OSHA compliance, hazard communication, lockout/tagout, confined space, fall protection, environmental regulations, emergency response, PPE, and incident investigation&lt;/li&gt;
