&lt;li&gt;Organize, schedule, and manage enrollments, attendance, and student performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop process specifications and research on new equipment, technologies and regulatory updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform special assignments (e.g., leading safety audits, incident reviews, or process modifications in the field)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage Production Management, Engineering, Quality, EHS, and other subject matter experts to gather feedback and implement process improvements for future training modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with third-party vendors for specialized resources and instruction (e.g., certified OSHA trainers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
