&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience designing, building, integrating, and testing complex multi-disciplinary systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with one or more of the following: launch vehicle or spacecraft integration, composite structure design or testing; test operations with gases/fluids, data acquisition setup, and field measurements&lt;/li&gt;
