&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Walk: Up to 10 hours per day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lift/Carry: Up to 50lbs. (unassisted) between 1 to 2 hours per day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Climb (ladder/stairs): Up to 3 hours per day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
