&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ec bvi bsc cnn cno cnp cnq cnr cns cnt cnu cnv cnw cnx cny cnz coa cob coc cod coe cof cog coh coi coj cok col com con coo cop coq cor cos&quot;&gt;1+ years of experience with TIG welding in a manufacturing environment or certificate of completion for welding from an accredited program within the last two years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
