&lt;p&gt;Pay range:&lt;br&gt;TIG Welder/Level 1: $23.00 - $27.00/hour&lt;br&gt;TIG Welder/Level 2: $26.00 - $32.50/hour&lt;br&gt;TIG Welder/Level 3: $31.00 - $38.00/hour&lt;/p&gt;
