&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in an engineering, math, or science discipline; OR 3+ years of experience working with automated processes in one of the following areas:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
