&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Advise and mentor students during their academic instruction and welding careers at SpaceX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Participate and contribute to team meetings, professional development, and other continuing education-related activities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Travel to schools, job fairs, or hiring events – both local and nationwide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
